# Sources for searched replies: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# (info and bestmove), fisher-2aj rules 1, 7 and 10, and python-chess 1.11.2
# for the independently checked exact values. Written 2026-11-23.
# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# and fisher-l7f owner decisions. Written 2026-11-22.
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok.
< readyok
> go
# Rules 1, 2, 5, 7 and 10. The published starting-position perft counts
# in expectations/perft.epd sum to 206603. Python-chess confirms cp 0.
< info depth 4 score cp 0 nodes 206603
# The owner uses the starting position before any position command.
< bestmove {legal}
# UCI position/go and bestmove. The reply carries a legal move.
> position startpos
> go
# Rules 1, 2, 5, 7 and 10. The published starting-position perft counts
# in expectations/perft.epd sum to 206603. Python-chess confirms cp 0.
< info depth 4 score cp 0 nodes 206603
< bestmove {legal}
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
